    <v:String x:Key="AboutPage_QuoteText">It focuses on a cleaner Play flow, quick Addons, skins, version tools, and a smoother everyday experience for Bedrock players. This is a community-made project and is not affiliated with Mojang, Microsoft, or Xbox.</v:String>
